{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10282280","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10282280","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1028228001:1":{"text":"芙拉贝尔老师，对不起，我不该偷偷溜出学院。但是……","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔老师，对不起，我不该偷偷溜出学院。但是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD340885CEB19011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028228002:0":{"text":"没关系，我听满满说了，你是为了寻找天赋，对不对？","source_cn":"没关系，我听满满说了，你是为了寻找天赋，对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD0D0C8DB52E058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028228003:1":{"text":"嗯，可找了这么大一圈，还是什么都没找到……","source_cn":"嗯，可找了这么大一圈，还是什么都没找到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDF7C400D24F36B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028228004:1":{"text":"兰迪，我和你一样，既不懂风语也不会剑术。小的时候，我也迷茫过很久，不知道自己的天赋是什么。","source_cn":"兰迪，我和你一样，既不懂风语也不会剑术。小的时候，我也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51C2CFEBADC12BE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028228005:1":{"text":"那……你找到了吗？","source_cn":"那……你找到了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C9E86B6DD390EF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docume